Iran conducted over 20 successful operations against US warships: Army commander 

Iran’s Army Navy carried out more than 20 successful operations against US warships and around 300 operations targeting American interests in various locations during the 40-day Ramadan War, including missile and drone strikes, a senior Iranian naval commander has said.

